# custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」ですって？<br>あの石なら、売れないからって、ロウェナが取引を止めたわ。<br>……好事家たちは、すぐに次の「獲物」を見つけるからね。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize>? Die werden als Zahlungsmittel nicht mehr akzeptiert. Die Sammler scheinen das Interesse daran verloren zu haben.
#. fr: Des <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1>, vous dites<nbsp>? Rowena ne les prend plus, ça ne se vendait pas. Mais vous savez, dans ce métier, on trouve vite un autre filon<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153:TEXT_CMNDEFTOMESTONEEXCHANGE_00153_HELP:1"
msgid "Seems every other day we stop dealing in this or that type of tomestone. Inevitably, there comes a point when Rowena says that they're not worth the hassle anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 必要なら「<sheet Item $n2 0>」と交換するけど……<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を持っていないあなたには、<br>関係のない話だったかしら。
#. de: Ich könnte deine gegen <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 4 1> eintauschen ... wenn du welche besitzen würdest.
#. fr: Si vous vouliez, je pourrais vous les échanger contre des <noun-fr Item 12 $n2 2 1>... Mais vous n'avez pas <noun-fr Item 8 $n1 2 1>, alors ça ne vous servira pas...
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153:TEXT_CMNDEFTOMESTONEEXCHANGE_00153_TALK_NOT_HAVE:1"
msgid "Might be as I still have use for them, though. If you have any you don't need, bring them here and I'll give you something more desirable in exchange."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 必要なら、あなたの「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を、<br>「<sheet Item $n3 0>」と交換するわよ？<br>あんなものでも、私の小遣いくらいにはなるもの。
#. de: Wenn du möchtest, gebe ich dir <noun-de Item 5 $n3 2 4 1> für <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1>. Zu ein bisschen Geld kann ich die sicher noch machen.
#. fr: Si vous voulez, je peux prendre vos <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1> et vous donner des <noun-fr Item 12 $n3 2 1> en échange. Alors<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153:TEXT_CMNDEFTOMESTONEEXCHANGE_00153_TALK_Q:1"
msgid "Might be as I still have use for them, though. If you have any you don't need, I'll give you something more desirable in exchange."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」×<num $n2> を<br>「<sheet Item $n3 0>」×<num $n4> に交換する？
#. de: <num $n2> <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-de Item 5 $n1 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1></if> gegen <num $n4> <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-de Item 5 $n3 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 5 $n3 2 4 1></if> tauschen?
#. fr: Échanger <kilo $n2 "<nbsp>"> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 $n2 1> contre <kilo $n4 "<nbsp>"> <noun-fr Item 12 $n3 $n4 1><nbsp>?
#. macro: <kilo $n2 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 2, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n4 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 4, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n3 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 3, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153:TEXT_CMNDEFTOMESTONEEXCHANGE_00153_EXCHANGE_Q:1"
msgid "Exchange <kilo $n2 \",\"> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> for <kilo $n4 \",\"> <noun-en Item 3 $n3 2 1>?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 交換する
#. de: Tauschen
#. fr: Échanger
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153:TEXT_CMNDEFTOMESTONEEXCHANGE_00153_EXCHANGE_YES:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. ja: やめる
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefTomestoneExchange_00153:TEXT_CMNDEFTOMESTONEEXCHANGE_00153_EXCHANGE_NO:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""
